WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:05.655
Taking away means some go away, and we find out how many are left.

00:06.105 --> 00:08.404
We start with five squares.

00:08.854 --> 00:12.058
Now take away two. Cross them out.

00:12.508 --> 00:18.220
Count how many are left. There are three. Five take away two is three.

00:18.670 --> 00:25.162
We can count back on a number line. Start at five and hop back two. Four, three.

00:25.162 --> 00:26.542
We land on three.

00:26.992 --> 00:33.609
Check with adding. Three plus two makes five. Adding and taking away are partners.
